guide polestar-completionist-alliance/dungeon-dire-maul
title Dire Maul (Completionist)
faction Alliance
category Dungeons
levels 56-60
zone Feralas
pitch Dire Maul, in Feralas.
why Every Alliance quest of Dire Maul: the chains that lead to it, the pick-ups before the run and the hand-ins after it.

